        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, a significant portion of the hardware devices we sell, including both proprietary and third-party products, are manufactured outside the United States, which subjects our supply chain to additional risks, including geopolitical, regulatory, and logistics-related disruptions.",
        "start_character": 32405,
        "end_character": 32693
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have a professional services team that provides customers with training, installation, and support services.",
        "start_character": 1513,
        "end_character": 1629
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our primary competitors are software companies that have historically provided singular, point solutions to new development properties and used third-party installation services, and hardware companies, many of which have closed architectures.",
        "start_character": 6846,
        "end_character": 7100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide in-house professional services with employees in our implementation, installation, and support departments which allows us to maintain consistent quality and service across markets.",
        "start_character": 8103,
        "end_character": 8295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With our holistic smart home operating system and in-house installation, training, and support services, we believe we offer a smart home solution that provides a full-service, end-to-end experience.",
        "start_character": 6390,
        "end_character": 6589
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also partner with several manufacturers to offer a range of compatible hardware options for any property, including:",
        "start_character": 24897,
        "end_character": 25016
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are an enterprise real estate technology company that provides a comprehensive management platform designed for property owners, managers and residents.",
        "start_character": 29,
        "end_character": 184
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are facilitating a more sustainable future by helping owners, operators, and residents reduce energy consumption, meet de-carbonization goals and achieve sustainability objectives.",
        "start_character": 27780,
        "end_character": 27963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have designed our smart home operating platform to enable our customers to more efficiently and effectively manage their properties and interface with their residents.",
        "start_character": 1632,
        "end_character": 1802
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have developed a scalable and operator-friendly smart home operating system that provides a comprehensive solution for the industry:",
        "start_character": 7445,
        "end_character": 7580
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We primarily sell our solutions through our internal sales organization to diverse customers, predominately in multifamily but also including single-family rental homeowners, homebuilders and iBuyers, across our operating markets.",
        "start_character": 27310,
        "end_character": 27540
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-089953",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-089953-e60aedbdc69affc9",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-089953",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "While several of the largest multifamily residential owners are current SmartRent customers, we believe that we have only begun to take advantage of the full market opportunity in residential and commercial real estate sectors and in domestic and international markets.",
        "start_character": 8296,
        "end_character": 8565
      }
